record.field:
% set accent = '#b00020'
% set badge_style = 'display:inline-block;padding:4px 12px;background:' + accent + ';color:#fff;font-weight:bold;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.5px'
% set button_style = 'display:inline-block;padding:8px 16px;background:' + accent + ';color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:3px;font-weight:bold'
% set kv_label = 'padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666'
% set footer_style = 'margin-top:24px;color:#888;font-size:12px'



CRITICAL

A scheduled action has failed on server ${object.server_name}.


Scheduled action${object.cron_id.name}

Started${object.date_start}

Ended${object.date_end}

Duration${object.duration_sec} s

Server${object.server_name}




            View in Cron History




            Show full error traceback

        ${object.error_traceback}



        Sent by Odoo Health Check. Manage recipients in Settings -> Health Check.

% set accent = '#b00020' if object.status == 'critical' else '#b08000' % set badge_text = object.status.upper() if object.status else 'WARNING' % set badge_style = 'display:inline-block;padding:4px 12px;background:' + accent + ';color:#fff;font-weight:bold;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.5px' % set button_style = 'display:inline-block;padding:8px 16px;background:' + accent + ';color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:3px;font-weight:bold' % set kv_label = 'padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666' % set footer_style = 'margin-top:24px;color:#888;font-size:12px'
${badge_text}
Disk usage on ${object.mount_path} has reached ${object.status}: ${'%.1f' % (object.used_pct or 0)}% used.
Check${object.check_type}
Mount${object.mount_path}
Status${object.status}
Used${'%.2f' % (object.used_pct or 0)}%
Total${'%.2f' % ((object.total_bytes or 0) / (1024.0 ** 3))} GB
Free${'%.2f' % ((object.free_bytes or 0) / (1024.0 ** 3))} GB
Time${object.date}
View in Disk Checks
One alert per worsening transition. Manage thresholds and recipients in Settings -> Health Check.
